      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why Parquet Exists\nThe [specification](https://github.com/apache/\nparquet-format/blob/ec90dd4/README.md#L34-L43)\nstates four goals:\n\n- A compressed, efficient columnar\nrepresentation of data.\n- Very efficient compression and encoding,\nchosen for each column.\n- Support for complex nested data structures.\n- One format that every data processing\nframework can use.\n\nThe first two goals are about cost: fewer\nbytes to store and fewer bytes to read. [How\nMuch Columnar Saves](#how-much-columnar-saves)\nmeasures them. The other two goals are about\nwhat a file can hold and who can read it.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-2f9b59148846",
      "originalText": "Why Parquet Exists\nThe [specification](https://github.com/apache/parquet-format/blob/ec90dd4/README.md#L34-L43) states four goals:\n\n- A compressed, efficient columnar representation of data.\n- Very efficient compression and encoding, chosen for each column.\n- Support for complex nested data structures.\n- One format that every data processing framework can use.\n\nThe first two goals are about cost: fewer bytes to store and fewer bytes to read. [How Much Columnar Saves](#how-much-columnar-saves) measures them. The other two goals are about what a file can hold and who can read it.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "why-parquet-exists"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
