    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2307961004,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-9361947c8f1d",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1312.0,
      "y": 1647.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 245.0,
      "seed": 224926,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Row Group\nA row group is a slice of consecutive rows.\nThe example file has two: rows 1 to 3, and\nrows 4 to 6. Read back with pyarrow, each\ncolumn shows as two pieces, one for each row\ngroup: `id: [[1,2,3],[4,5,6]]`. A row group\nholds one column chunk for each column. The [s\npecification](https://github.com/apache/parque\nt-format/blob/ec90dd4/README.md#L251-L257)\nrecommends large row groups, from 512 MB to 1\nGB. Large row groups allow large sequential\nreads, but the writer needs more memory. The\nexample uses three rows per group only to keep\nthe picture small.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-9361947c8f1d",
      "originalText": "Row Group\nA row group is a slice of consecutive rows. The example file has two: rows 1 to 3, and rows 4 to 6. Read back with pyarrow, each column shows as two pieces, one for each row group: `id: [[1,2,3],[4,5,6]]`. A row group holds one column chunk for each column. The [specification](https://github.com/apache/parquet-format/blob/ec90dd4/README.md#L251-L257) recommends large row groups, from 512 MB to 1 GB. Large row groups allow large sequential reads, but the writer needs more memory. The example uses three rows per group only to keep the picture small.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "row-group"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9121260216,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-dbe717ef8462",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
