    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4088984066,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-767013ce0ee0",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 2509.6,
      "y": 1647.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 227.5,
      "seed": 553884,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Page\nA column chunk is a run of pages. A page is\nthe smallest unit that the writer encodes and\ncompresses ([glossary](https://github.com/apac\nhe/parquet-format/blob/ec90dd4/README.md#L79-L\n81)). A reader can skip pages that it does not\nneed. When a chunk uses dictionary encoding,\nits first page is the dictionary page. The\ndata pages follow ([specification](https://git\nhub.com/apache/parquet-format/blob/ec90dd4/REA\nDME.md#L207-L218)). In the example file, the\n`id` chunk of row group 0 has a dictionary\npage at byte 4 and a data page at byte 41.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-767013ce0ee0",
      "originalText": "Page\nA column chunk is a run of pages. A page is the smallest unit that the writer encodes and compresses ([glossary](https://github.com/apache/parquet-format/blob/ec90dd4/README.md#L79-L81)). A reader can skip pages that it does not need. When a chunk uses dictionary encoding, its first page is the dictionary page. The data pages follow ([specification](https://github.com/apache/parquet-format/blob/ec90dd4/README.md#L207-L218)). In the example file, the `id` chunk of row group 0 has a dictionary page at byte 4 and a data page at byte 41.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "page"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
