    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8138790776,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-3293bd507246",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1301.2,
      "y": 2068.25,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 386.40000000000003,
      "height": 157.5,
      "seed": 252031,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How Much Columnar Saves\nThe measurements use one table of 300,000 rows\nwith the columns `id`, `city`, `fare`, and\n`note`. The table is stored three ways. CSV is\na row layout in a text file. SQLite is a row\nlayout in a database file, with `id` as the\nprimary key. Parquet is the column layout. The\nthree nodes below hold the numbers. About the\nNumbers describes the files and the method.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-3293bd507246",
      "originalText": "How Much Columnar Saves\nThe measurements use one table of 300,000 rows with the columns `id`, `city`, `fare`, and `note`. The table is stored three ways. CSV is a row layout in a text file. SQLite is a row layout in a database file, with `id` as the primary key. Parquet is the column layout. The three nodes below hold the numbers. About the Numbers describes the files and the method.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "how-much-columnar-saves"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2173651091,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-d43ee08881f9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1879.6000000000001,
      "y": 1907.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
      "seed": 810336,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3,
        "value": 8
      },
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text-d43ee08881f9"
        },
        {
          "id": "edge-912901763b66",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1,
