      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7619784325,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-773d311b5dc5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1301.2,
      "y": 3185.75,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 386.40000000000003,
      "height": 227.5,
      "seed": 711156,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Whole Rows Cost More\nThe column layout has a price. A row is spread\nover every column. To rebuild one whole row, a\nreader must read from every column of the row\ngroup that holds it. In the test table,\nfetching the row with `id` 250000 took SQLite\n0.06 ms. Parquet needed 3.2 ms and 5,182,765\nbytes, which is one row group and the footer.\nCSV took 33 ms and scanned 16,335,389 bytes to\nreach the row. SQLite is fast here because its\nprimary key leads to the page that holds the\nwhole row. Parquet suits queries that read\nmany rows of a few columns.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-773d311b5dc5",
      "originalText": "Whole Rows Cost More\nThe column layout has a price. A row is spread over every column. To rebuild one whole row, a reader must read from every column of the row group that holds it. In the test table, fetching the row with `id` 250000 took SQLite 0.06 ms. Parquet needed 3.2 ms and 5,182,765 bytes, which is one row group and the footer. CSV took 33 ms and scanned 16,335,389 bytes to reach the row. SQLite is fast here because its primary key leads to the page that holds the whole row. Parquet suits queries that read many rows of a few columns.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "whole-rows-cost-more"
      }
    },
